{"3166050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quite a Ride", "steam_appid": 3166050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road is deserted. The fog is unnaturally thick. The trees whisper in the wind. Your phone buzzes with cryptic messages from an unknown sender. And something, someone, is hunting you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in this shifting twilight, your only hope is your bicycle. Pedal through changing countryside landscapes, uncover hidden laboratories, and evade the monstrous beings that emerge from the fog, their footsteps always just behind you.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.poster.avif?t=1773352741\" width=540 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.webm?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.mp4?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE BLIND SPOT</strong><br>A desolate and remote forest in Eastern Europe. A mysterious fog rolled in years ago earning it's unique name. Ride through the scattered pieces of the zone, each governed by its own rules and warped logic. Investigate abandoned locations, and solve environmental puzzles. Feed your findings to your living Mindmap, connect clues &amp; uncover the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOMALY RESEARCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blind Spot is crawling with supernatural anomalies, unpredictable entities lurking in the fog. Some watch, some interfere, some hunt. Every anomaly is unique in behaviour, appearance, and threat. Capture them on camera to study their patterns, survive encounters, and gather crucial information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIKE OR DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Bike is your lifeline, pedal to explore, charge your phone and escape! Use the strange-tech FM radio fused to your bike-frame to unlock new paths. The Longer you stay in the Blind Spot can reveal more answers, but increases your exposure to anomalies. Be sure your tyres are pumped up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETURN TO [ █████]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, return to your base to analyze discoveries, rest and plan your next journey. No two runs are the same, zones, anomalies, and hazards change dynamically, keeping every ride unpredictable. Some say that the source of the fog is somewhere in the zone. Will you uncover it before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.poster.avif?t=1773352741\" width=540 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.webm?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.mp4?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road is deserted. The fog is unnaturally thick. The trees whisper in the wind. Your phone buzzes with cryptic messages from an unknown sender. And something, someone, is hunting you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in this shifting twilight, your only hope is your bicycle. Pedal through changing countryside landscapes, uncover hidden laboratories, and evade the monstrous beings that emerge from the fog, their footsteps always just behind you.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.poster.avif?t=1773352741\" width=540 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.webm?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/19921af4926e80868cd1b36d35399947.mp4?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE BLIND SPOT</strong><br>A desolate and remote forest in Eastern Europe. A mysterious fog rolled in years ago earning it's unique name. Ride through the scattered pieces of the zone, each governed by its own rules and warped logic. Investigate abandoned locations, and solve environmental puzzles. Feed your findings to your living Mindmap, connect clues &amp; uncover the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOMALY RESEARCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blind Spot is crawling with supernatural anomalies, unpredictable entities lurking in the fog. Some watch, some interfere, some hunt. Every anomaly is unique in behaviour, appearance, and threat. Capture them on camera to study their patterns, survive encounters, and gather crucial information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIKE OR DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Bike is your lifeline, pedal to explore, charge your phone and escape! Use the strange-tech FM radio fused to your bike-frame to unlock new paths. The Longer you stay in the Blind Spot can reveal more answers, but increases your exposure to anomalies. Be sure your tyres are pumped up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RETURN TO [ █████]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, return to your base to analyze discoveries, rest and plan your next journey. No two runs are the same, zones, anomalies, and hazards change dynamically, keeping every ride unpredictable. Some say that the source of the fog is somewhere in the zone. Will you uncover it before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.poster.avif?t=1773352741\" width=540 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.webm?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/extras/a5c6cf9a1c24cfc25049f8ac8295442e.mp4?t=1773352741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Pedal through the fog, but never look back. Trapped in a constantly shifting horror, you must ride, conserve your phone's battery, and decode cryptic messages to escape. Explore, survive, uncover the truth.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166050/b01e7ac546abc887768baca5f9c2649a6fd47b5b/header.jpg?t=1773352741", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite